config BR2_PACKAGE_TC100_HTTPSD
	bool "tc100-httpsd"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_MBEDTLS
	help
	  Low-CPU native HTTPS reverse proxy for BusyBox httpd + httpfront
	  (src/httpsd of this source tree): single-process non-blocking poll()
	  event loop, TLS 1.2+ with ChaCha20-Poly1305 and X25519 preferred,
	  HTTP/1.1 Keep-Alive, TLS session tickets and server session cache,
	  and persistent ECDSA P-256 certificate in /mnt/config.
